OL,3,GNEWSABikers say 'idiots' threaten
OL,4,Afuture of 40-year meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FBikers fear a "few idiots" could
OL,7,Fjeopardise the future of a cherished
OL,8,Fcafe meet that has run for 40 years.
OL,10,FThe H Cafe's Monday meet has been
OL,11,Fdescribed as "Oxfordshire's biggest
OL,12,Fweekly bike night", but it has recently
OL,13,Fseen a rise in anti-social behaviour
OL,14,Fand dangerous driving.
OL,16,FOver the summer, an increase in reports
OL,17,Fby members of the public prompted
OL,18,Fspecial operations by Thames Valley
OL,19,FPolice, which found people riding
OL,20,Fwithout insurance and saw bikes seized.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
