OL,3,GNEWSABikers say 'idiots' threaten
OL,4,Afuture of 40-year meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut local riders, who describe the
OL,7,Fvenue as a "lifeline", are now
OL,8,Fconcerned it could fall to the same
OL,9,Ffate as the Ace Cafe in London, which
OL,10,Fhas paused meets for similar reasons.
